title: mf repo init
tags: [[CLI command]] Daemon
kind: reference
summary: Initialise a new repository and print its UUID

Creates a repository and prints its uuid ([[Creating and loading a repository]]).
The new root then gets the `default` ignore preset's patterns (`--ignore <names>`
picks other presets, comma- or space-separated; `--no-ignore` leaves its ignore set
empty). A missing `core/ignore-presets.toml` makes `init` fail rather than skip the
presets, unless `--no-ignore` is given ([[No runtime fallback]]).
